<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - UBS upgrades Baan.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - UBS upgrades Baan.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- UBS Securities said analyst Joseph Farley upgraded Baan Co N.V. to buy from hold, citing strong fourth quarter results.</p>
<p>-- The analyst raised his 1997 earnings estimate on the company to $0.70 a share from $0.60, and set a 1998 forecast of $1.05, a UBS report said.</p>
<p>-- He put a 12-month price target of $60 on the stock, which was up two to 43-5/8.</p>
</text>
